      "widgets_values": [
        "TEMPORARY AUDIO EXAMPLE: Upload your clip in TEMPORARY AUDIO. The H3 audio VAE encodes it directly into the reference chain; nothing is saved. Existing character/outfit, Turbo LoRA, sampler, resolution selector and generated-audio output are retained.\n\nSAVED AUDIO: prepare audio.safetensors with workflow 05, then replace the Encode H3 Audio Refpack output feeding node 30 with Load RefPack. Keep role audio. First audio is <Audio 1>, next is <Audio 2>.\n\nThis uses native audio reference guidance. Exact source playback, exact lyrics and lip sync are not guaranteed. The audio reference is kept at full length, matching native standalone reference behavior; trim it before encoding if desired."
